<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>{{.SenderName}} - 组织邀请</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#EFF2F7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width:520px; margin:30px auto; padding:20px 16px;">
        <!-- 主卡片：圆角 + 阴影 -->
        <div style="background:#FFFFFF; border-radius:32px; box-shadow:0 25px 45px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); overflow:hidden;">
            
            <!-- 装饰条：科技蓝渐变光效 -->
            <div style="height:6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1E88E5, #64B5F6, #90CAF9, #1E88E5); background-size: 200% auto;"></div>
            
            <!-- 内边距区域 -->
            <div style="padding: 36px 32px 44px 32px;">
                
                <!-- 品牌区 + 太阳能标识 -->
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 28px;">☀️</span>
                    <span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; color: #1F2A3E; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-left: 10px;">CSERGY</span>
                    <span style="background:#EFF2F9; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:40px; font-size: 12px; font-weight:500; color:#1E88E5; margin-left: 10px;">智慧能源</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 邀请标题区 -->
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 1;">🤝</div>
                    <h1 style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A1C2F;">邀请加入组织</h1>
                    <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A6B84;">{{.SenderName}} 邀请您加入团队</p>
                    <div style="display:inline-block; margin-top: 14px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E3F2FD, #BBDEFB); padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 40px; color: #1565C0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">{{.OrganizationName}}</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 角色说明 -->
                <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #3E4A5E; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
                    您将以 <strong style="color:#1E88E5; background:#EFF6FE; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 8px;">{{.RoleName}}</strong> 身份加入，<br>
                    点击下方按钮完成注册并激活账号：
                </p>
                
                <!-- 主 CTA 按钮 -->
                <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 8px;">
                    <a href="{{.InviteURL}}" style="display:inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E88E5, #42A5F5); color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration:none; padding: 15px 44px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -8px rgba(30,136,229,0.5);">立即接受邀请 →</a>
                </div>
                <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9AA6B9; margin: 12px 0 0;">如按钮无法点击，请复制下方链接到浏览器打开</p>
                <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7E8A9E; margin: 4px 0 0; word-break: break-all;">{{.InviteURL}}</p>
                
                <!-- 备用邀请码 -->
                <div style="background: #F7FAFF; border: 1px dashed #BBDEFB; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 24px 0 0;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #7E8A9E; text-align: center;">备用邀请码（页面提示输入时使用）</p>
                    <div style="text-align:center; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #1363B3;">{{.TokenHint}}****</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 过期提示 -->
                <div style="background: #FFF8E1; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 16px 0 0;">
                    <p style="margin:0; font-size: 13px; color:#B26A00; line-height: 1.7;">⏰ 此邀请将在 <strong>{{.ExpiresHours}}</strong> 小时后失效，请尽快完成注册。若您并未发起此邀请，请忽略本邮件。</p>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 页脚 -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #7E8A9E;">© CSERGY · 智慧光伏解决方案</span>
                <span style="width:4px; height:4px; background:#C0CCDA; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block;"></span>
                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #7E8A9E;">让能源更智能</span>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #A6B1C6; margin: 0;">CSERGY | 清洁能源 · 高效逆变</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #A6B1C6; margin: 4px 0 0;">此邮件由 CSERGY 系统自动发出，请勿直接回复</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
